          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "అభిప్రాయభేదం — abhiprāyabhēdaṁ — \"difference of opinion\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "మా ఇద్దరి మధ్య చిన్న అభిప్రాయభేదం వచ్చింది. mā iddari madhya cinna abhiprāyabhēdaṁ vaccindi. A small difference of opinion came up between the two of us."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Two words you can take apart: అభిప్రాయం, an opinion, which you know, and భేదం, a difference."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "అభిప్రాయభేదం (abhiprāyabhēdaṁ) is built from two Sanskrit words: abhiprāya, \"aim, intention\", which Telugu uses for an opinion, and bheda, \"a splitting, a breaking apart\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
